<title>UK: PT Ongko sets $100 million seven-year bond.</title>
<headline>PT Ongko sets $100 million seven-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Bank Boston and Bear Stearns.</p>
<p> BORROWER   PT ONGKO</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	COUPON     **	  MATURITY	    .04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    =</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+400 BP</p>
<p> GOV LAW    N.Y	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =/BB	DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NOTES	**TO BE PRICED</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
